 "permalink": "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/2983182/new-delete-malloc-free",
 "body_html": "<p><code>new</code> and <code>delete</code> are said to be preprocessors while <code>malloc</code> and <code>free</code> are functions. What is meant by <code>new</code> and <code>delete</code> being preprocessors?</p>\n",
 "passes": [
